    "Double-click a DMG and Sapphire does the rest: mounts the image, installs the app into your Applications folder, unmounts the image, and can even move the DMG to the Trash. Encrypted images and package installers are handed off to the normal macOS flow.": {
      "comment": "Private full build: Sapphire/App Settings/ArchivesAndDMGInstallerSettingsView.swift:335",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Double-click a DMG and Sapphire does the rest: mounts the image, installs the app into your Applications folder, unmounts the image, and can even move the DMG to the Trash. Encrypted images and package installers are handed off to the normal macOS flow."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连按两次 DMG，Sapphire 会完成后续操作：挂载磁盘映像，将应用安装到“应用程序”文件夹，卸载映像，还可以将 DMG 移到废纸篓。加密映像和软件包安装器会交由 macOS 按常规流程处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Double-click an archive (or choose Open With → Sapphire) and Sapphire extracts it for you: smart destinations, password prompts for encrypted archives, and optional cleanup — all using the archive tools that ship with macOS.": {
      "comment": "Private full build: Sapphire/App Settings/ArchivesAndDMGInstallerSettingsView.swift:97",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Double-click an archive (or choose Open With → Sapphire) and Sapphire extracts it for you: smart destinations, password prompts for encrypted archives, and optional cleanup — all using the archive tools that ship with macOS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连按两次归档（或选择“打开方式”→“Sapphire”），Sapphire 就会为你解压：智能选择目标位置、为加密归档提示输入密码，并可选择清理原文件，全部使用 macOS 自带的归档工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
