        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set up your Dock the way you like it (drag in the apps and folders you use for a task), then capture it as a preset — or start from a Blank Preset and build a custom Dock right here. Create one for coding, another for design — and switch with one click or a hotkey."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按你的喜好布置程序坞（拖入某项任务需要的应用和文件夹），然后将其捕获为预设；也可以从空白预设开始，在这里自定义程序坞。为编程、设计等任务分别创建预设，点按一下或使用热键即可切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
